# 🚀 LaunchPad - Modern Developer Landing Page & Auth Flow

LaunchPad is a responsive, high-performance SaaS landing page and authentication portal built using pure HTML5, CSS3 (CSS Variables, Flexbox, Grid), and Vanilla JavaScript (ES6+). It features dark/light mode toggling, interactive feature grids, and client-side authentication validation.

![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/Status-Live-brightgreen)
![Tech Stack](https://img.shields.io/badge/Tech-HTML5%20%7C%20CSS3%20%7C%20JS-blue)
![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-orange)

🔗 **Live Demo:** [https://launchpad-landing-page.vercel.app](https://launchpad-landing-page.vercel.app)

---

## ✨ Key Features

- **🎨 Dynamic Dark/Light Theme:** Smooth transition between light and dark mode using CSS Custom Properties (`var(--bg-color)`).
- **📱 Fully Responsive Design:** Modern Flexbox and CSS Grid layout optimized for mobile, tablet, and desktop viewports.
- **🔐 Interactive Auth Portal (`login.html`):**
  - Seamless tab switching between **Login** and **Register** forms without page reloads.
  - Show/Hide password toggle (`👁️️` / `🙈`).
  - Real-time client-side form validation (Email regex check, password strength, and match validation).
  - Dynamic success/error alert banners.
- **⚡ Zero External Dependencies:** Fast, lightweight, and dependency-free (Vanilla JS).

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Technology | Usage |
| :--- | :--- |
| **HTML5** | Semantic layout structure and modern form components |
| **CSS3** | Flexbox, Grid, CSS Variables for theming, CSS Transitions |
| **JavaScript (ES6+)** | DOM Manipulation, Form Validation, Theme State Logic |
| **Vercel / Netlify** | Continuous Deployment & Cloud Hosting |

